---
title: Centroid View Refresh
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant ClusterSvc as IdentityClusteringService
    participant Context as TenantContextManager
    participant Session as AsyncSession
    participant MV as mv_identity_cluster_centroids

    ClusterSvc->>Context: refresh_centroid_view()
    Context->>Session: SET LOCAL app.bypass_rls = 'true'
    Context->>MV: REFRESH MATERIALIZED VIEW mv_identity_cluster_centroids
    Context->>Session: RESET app.bypass_rls
    MV-->>ClusterSvc: centroids ready for rep matching + suggestions
